# Force textual diffs for source files.
#
# src/utils/currentSession.js used to embed two literal NUL bytes as a join()
# separator (now written as the equivalent backslash-u-0000 escape). A NUL makes
# git, grep and `file` classify the blob as binary, so changes to it rendered as
# "Bin 10020 -> 11095 bytes" instead of a reviewable diff -- on the very file
# that defines the frontend permission gates. `diff` only affects diff
# rendering; it does not touch line endings, so nothing gets renormalized.
*.js diff
*.vue diff
